# Notice UI theme (dialogs / forms)

Target look: soft mobile-MMO / RO Origin **Notice** dialogs — light panel, blue header, gold+blue actions.

## Canonical reference

- Structure/styles: `client/ui/rml/account.rml`, `region.rml`, `server.rml` + shared `notice.rcss`
- Soft-AA skins: `client/ui/rml/frames/notice/*.tga`
- Generator: `python tools/gen-notice-skin.py`
- Docs: `docs/UI_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` → Notice section

## Visual recipe

- Off-white body `#f5f9ff`, blue header gradient `#7eb4f0` → `#5a96dc`
- Header title: white bold ~20dp, centered
- Labels/muted text: `#5a7ab0`
- Inputs: white fill, soft rounded shell via `input_*.tga` 9-slice
- Lists: `notice-list-shell` + `notice-list-item` / `notice-list-item-active`
- Actions: gold Register / confirm secondary; blue Login / primary
- Exit/Back: smaller blue pill (`notice-exit`), same soft-AA skin as Login
- Font: `LatoLatin` from `client/ui/rml/fonts/`

## DX9 hard constraints

- Never `box-shadow` / filters (broken/white panels)
- No large CSS `border-radius` on shells/buttons — soft curves come from TGA 9-slice / tiled-horizontal only
- Bake header blue into **panel top tiles** (`panel_tl/t/tr`) — do not stack a second soft header layer (transparent corners punch through)
- Keep AA feather tight (~0.85px in gen script) so edges stay sharp, not blurry
- Center control text with `line-height` == control `height`
- Decorator paths from client cwd: `ui/rml/frames/notice/...`

## New form checklist

1. Clone `region.rml` / `account.rml` shell (`notice` / `notice-header` / `notice-body`)
2. Link `notice.rcss` (+ thin screen RCSS if needed)
3. Keep C++ element IDs stable when binding; mirror `CRmlUiRegionForm` / `CRmlUiAccountForm`
4. Regen skins only via `tools/gen-notice-skin.py` if chrome changes
5. Suppress legacy `CForm` with Hide / SetIsShow(false); drive Show* APIs through RmlUi
